'''Dark End to the Holiday''' (暗黒の連休明け, ''Ankoku no Renkyū Ake'', '''Dark Ending of a Long Weekend''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

